\section*{Subsystem Roles}
\begin{itemize}
  \item \textbf{Regeneration Timing}: Controls when regeneration is allowed via $T_{\text{reg}}$ and damping $\sigma_{\text{threshold}}$.
  \item \textbf{Cell-Cycle Invariants}: Enforces $\Delta \mathcal{I}_{\text{cc}} \equiv 0$ and legal mitosis bounds.
  \item \textbf{Tissue Manifold Closure}: Restores tissue geometry using metric updates and convergence of $\epsilon$.
  \item \textbf{Recursion-Safe Mitosis}: Prevents runaway division by enforcing $n \leq n_{\max}$ and terminating unsafe lineages.
  \item \textbf{Suprakernel Sovereign Lock}: Maintains global invariant clamps and oversees all phases.
  \item \textbf{Sovereign Ledger}: Records each cycle for immutable provenance and audit.
\end{itemize}

